<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1001A_S0009" variety="S0009">
<name>Lighting</name>
<ttl id="1001A_S0009_7420N_T0015" variety="T0015">
<name>Lighting System</name>
<para id="RM000002ZYW000X" category="C" type-id="303CC" name-id="603KS-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B2415</dtccode>
<dtcname>Wheel Speed Sensor Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002ZYW000X_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000065J00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The headlight leveling computer assembly receives the vehicle speed signal from the combination meter assembly.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.78in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="4.31in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Diagnosis Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Inspection Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B2415</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Vehicle speed signal malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Vehicle speed signal circuit malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Headlight Leveling Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Combination Meter Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Wire Harness and Connector</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002ZYW000X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000065K00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E140371J01" width="7.106578999in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002ZYW000X_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___000065L00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>After replacing the headlight leveling computer assembly, initialization is necessary. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000030GL000X"/>)</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002ZYW000X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000002ZYW000X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000065M00000">
<testtitle>Go to Meter &amp; Gauge System (Vehicle Speed Signal Circuit)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect the vehicle speed signal circuit in Meter &amp; Gauge System (Vehicle Speed Signal Circuit). (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002YMX000X"/>)</ptxt>
<atten4>
<ptxt>During the inspection of Meter &amp; Gauge System (Vehicle Speed Signal Circuit), if there is an instruction to return to each system for inspection, follow the instruction and proceed to the next step.  </ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002ZYW000X_04_0002" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002ZYW000X_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___000065N00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Combination Meter Assembly - Headlight Leveling Computer Assembly)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D701ZX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the combination meter assembly and headlight leveling computer assembly connectors.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals of the vehicle side wire harness connectors.</ptxt>
</test1>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E141402J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>36(+S) - 16(SPDR)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002ZYW000X_04_0003" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002ZYW000X_04_0004" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002ZYW000X_04_0003">
<testtitle>Replace Headlight Leveling Computer Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000001X8N001X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002ZYW000X_04_0004">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
